name: sim.getPointCloudPoints
description: Retrieves point positions from a point cloud
luaSynopsis: list points = sim.getPointCloudPoints(int pointCloudHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float[] points = sim.getPointCloudPoints(int pointCloudHandle)
inputs:
1. pointCloudHandle: handle of the point cloud
outputs:
1. points: the point [x y z] positions, relative to the point cloud reference frame
